    "detailed_description": "TrainFormation is a simple, fast-paced puzzle game created by one student as a university project. Place rails in front of an ever-accelerating train to cross procedurally generated levels, reach stations, collect power ups and make it as far as you can!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build a path for the train</h2>Swap hexagonal tiles to create a path for the train. Make sure to find the matching rails and terrain, or the train will not make it through! <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">\u2800</ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077150/extras/7a531fbbc08c56e7d9ba9035d7bafc2f.poster.avif?t=1660911218\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077150/extras/7a531fbbc08c56e7d9ba9035d7bafc2f.webm?t=1660911218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077150/extras/7a531fbbc08c56e7d9ba9035d7bafc2f.mp4?t=1660911218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Reach stations and collect power ups</h2>Make it to a station and take a moment to breathe. Use specific rail tiles to collect power ups to help you in your toughest moments!<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">\u2800</ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077150/extras/6369348b32fd313fb423f323fba00389.poster.avif?t=1660911218\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077150/extras/6369348b32fd313fb423f323fba00389.webm?t=1660911218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077150/extras/6369348b32fd313fb423f323fba00389.mp4?t=1660911218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Make it as far as you can</h2>Reach new levels and face the difficult terrain. Hold on tight as the train continues to accelerate!<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">\u2800</ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077150/extras/32172095fef33999d0de05868bb86ac7.poster.avif?t=1660911218\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077150/extras/32172095fef33999d0de05868bb86ac7.webm?t=1660911218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077150/extras/32172095fef33999d0de05868bb86ac7.mp4?t=1660911218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "TrainFormation is a simple, fast-paced puzzle game created by one student as a university project. Place rails in front of an ever-accelerating train to cross procedurally generated levels, reach stations, collect power ups and make it as far as you can!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build a path for the train</h2>Swap hexagonal tiles to create a path for the train. Make sure to find the matching rails and terrain, or the train will not make it through! <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">\u2800</ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077150/extras/7a531fbbc08c56e7d9ba9035d7bafc2f.poster.avif?t=1660911218\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077150/extras/7a531fbbc08c56e7d9ba9035d7bafc2f.webm?t=1660911218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077150/extras/7a531fbbc08c56e7d9ba9035d7bafc2f.mp4?t=1660911218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Reach stations and collect power ups</h2>Make it to a station and take a moment to breathe. Use specific rail tiles to collect power ups to help you in your toughest moments!<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">\u2800</ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077150/extras/6369348b32fd313fb423f323fba00389.poster.avif?t=1660911218\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077150/extras/6369348b32fd313fb423f323fba00389.webm?t=1660911218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077150/extras/6369348b32fd313fb423f323fba00389.mp4?t=1660911218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Make it as far as you can</h2>Reach new levels and face the difficult terrain. Hold on tight as the train continues to accelerate!<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">\u2800</ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077150/extras/32172095fef33999d0de05868bb86ac7.poster.avif?t=1660911218\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077150/extras/32172095fef33999d0de05868bb86ac7.webm?t=1660911218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077150/extras/32172095fef33999d0de05868bb86ac7.mp4?t=1660911218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
